        "name": "success_bonus",
        "description": "One-shot terminal-aligned success bonus. Only paid when episode terminates with both legs contact, near pad (distance < 0.15), low vertical speed (abs(vy) < 0.5), and upright (abs(angle) < 0.2). Uses success_flag to ensure one-shot payment.",
